#. type: Content of: <para>
#: blfs-en/xincludes/mozconfigure.xml:10
msgid ""
"Second, either as the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user "
"export the <envar>$SHELL</envar> environment variable using <command>export "
"SHELL=/bin/sh</command> or else prepend <envar>SHELL=/bin/sh</envar> when "
"running the <command>configure</command> command."
msgstr ""
"Segundo, como o(a) usuário(a) <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem> exporte a variável de ambiente "
"<envar>$SHELL</envar> usando <command>export SHELL=/bin/sh</command> ou, "
"então, preceda <envar>SHELL=/bin/sh</envar> ao executar o comando "
"<command>configure</command>."
